{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_03",
  "title": "油泼扯面",
  "storyCode": "OR-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5b7db1db39fedf3740d0defd57ddda0e4dc0fff146d57962834039ec456b8e4f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一大早，小饭馆的门外尚冷清，仅有几只羽兽在落叶上来回蹦跶。\n对门大理寺的值夜人打了个长长的呵欠，惊得羽兽四散飞离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨晚做了噩梦，梦见有只循兽把我后厨里的面粉都吃光了。好可怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......学会了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这黑眼圈......难道真做了一整夜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，也就到后半宿吧......行箸到现在还没醒呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先不说别的了，快尝尝这面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你没学会和面，就煮了一把挂面来给我交差？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可不是一般的挂面。这是行箸和我挑遍了市面上所有种类的挂面后，精心挑选出的口感最接近你做的面的一款。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，相比于手工面，口感还是略差一些的。不过行箸还对你汤底配方稍微进行了一点调整——保证做出来的口味和你做的差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歪门邪说，投机取巧，还乱改我的配方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先别急着下结论，你尝尝再说嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小大厨皱着眉，用筷子挑起几缕面，小心翼翼地闻了闻，才送入口中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说话啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们......为什么会觉得这样做就能行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主要是行箸都快饿得不行了。当时想着，与其就这么和面团干耗着，不如先用你的配方做碗我能做的面给她吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后来想了想，长寿面最重要的可能不是味道，而是让吃面的人有被祝福的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些人就是学不会你这一手做面条的功夫，但是用一把挂面也能给自己或家人送上祝福，这就是长寿面的意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，这面条黄灿灿的，是不是比你那一碗看上去还热闹一点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......当然，投机取巧也是事实啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说“被祝福的感觉”......你觉得自己做出来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......应该吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨晚第一次成功做出这碗面的时候，我和行箸一起分享了。我觉得吃得很开心，她还偷偷抹眼泪来着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把手工面换成了挂面，也跟着调整了香油和盐的用量，倒也算动了脑子......那位姑娘的舌头真是厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是挂面煮完需要过凉水，你做是做了，却没把凉水沥干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凉水留得太多，降低了汤的温度，也影响了整碗面的口感。要想精益求精的话，这些细节下次最好也要照顾到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......好，我记住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，你说这话的意思是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打住，我就是看在你花了心思的分上，决定继续教你罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和面还是要接着练的，你总不能真的打算带着一把挂面去参加比赛吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这只是师父心软，觉得徒弟开窍了一点。但客人到底买不买单，还是要检验一番的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......要怎么检验？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等会儿客人来了，如果有点面条的，你就做一碗送去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客人要是觉得不好吃，那你就接着练习吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我这就去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这位客人！要不要来一碗本店新推出的特色长寿面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天又不是我的生日，怎么平白无故让我吃长寿面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......小店菜品试新，让客人免费品尝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对......您要是吃完觉得满意，还是付一下钱比较好，我也得给我们老板交差......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真有意思，这小店的生意还有这种做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把面放下吧，就算我点的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（热切的眼神）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......还有事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没，没！我就是想等您吃过后，听听您的评价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好......我吃就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "食客拿起筷子，先后夹起一根面、一片青菜、一点葱花，都仔细品尝过。\n他动作优雅，可不一会的工夫，一碗面已经见底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "味道如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......好吃，很好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真......真的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这汤很鲜，所用食材也很讲究，如果再炖上一天一夜，味道能更完美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我已经很饿了，等不了那么久。如果为了那点“完美”再等上一天一夜，我恐怕早就饿死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他想要求一份完美的味道，但客人却等不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便我愿意等他，有些事也是没法再等下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您这话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要紧，你把我的话转告你们老板就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "食客站起身，他衣服上的纹样流光溢彩，光线在他身侧扭曲虚化，让人看不清他的面孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，您......您还没给钱呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着光鲜的食客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从我账上扣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g8_baizaoacademy"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管你要查的到底是什么，出去以后，千万不要说这份档案是从学宫拿到的，记住了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？还有什么问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还记不记得......1062年，那场血案......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这可不是什么能随便谈起的话题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我只是突然想起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你口中那位，支持学界变法改革，造福无数寒门学子的太师，和四十年前，弑君谋逆的太师，真的是同一个人吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我没有办法回答你的问题。不了解的事，我绝不会妄言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没有见过那位太师，只是曾经读过她一些关于民生政治的论著。从书中能看出作者的见识之深、学识之广，这也让我获益良多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但恐怕，人是很难一概而论的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这样说，不正意味着，你对于当年案件的结果，并不是完全相信的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "青砚，你脸上可从来藏不住事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你果然还是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大理寺的卷宗，容不下不清不白的案件......不管是多大的案件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是大理寺少卿的职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要做的事，我不会劝你别做。可无论如何，你都要学会保护好自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......你的父母入山闭关前还拜托我对你多加关照，你要是出了什么事，我可就没脸再去见他们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我又不是小辈，怎么会总要人照顾——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年轻的时候，任谁都是这样的想法。可作为母亲看着左乐一天天长大，我心里也压上了一块石头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当长辈的不惦记着孩子的安危，又能惦记些什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可如果要让他们知道，我为了你的“安危”考虑，阻止你履行大理寺少卿的职责，他们才会真的怪我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢......姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......你口口声声叫我姐姐，可在我眼里，你一直都是和左乐一辈的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，玉门已经接近百灶，这几天，你还没有见过左将军？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "局势已经迫在眉睫。兵部日夜开会研究，他也必须坐镇一线。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和他，谁都不能擅离职守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这场争端......难道真的无法避免了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是我可以决断的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作为兵部参知，我的职责就是尽最大的努力，尽可能精准地演算战争结果。要是心存偏私，那就是对大炎万千百姓的不负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不会在你的职责中退让分毫，那我也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望一切，平安顺遂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒也不用太过担心，如果是无可避免的结果，那不如泰然处之。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中秋节的时候，要是自己一个人的话，就来家里吃顿饭吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，一定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......我突然想起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚才不是问我，谁可以修改学宫的档案资料？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然是极端情况，但也的确有过这样的个例......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不能说是修改。但如果学宫里的某一份档案完全消失不见的话，那只能是转移去了一个地方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "景教授",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1620_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......刑部死狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g7_zuosroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父亲不在......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "距上次来到这里转眼已过了大半年的时间，屋中陈设未变，只有沙盘上，象征战火的标志又多出不少。\n孤城拒守，两相遥望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "熟悉而厚重的声音在身后响起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太合叔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你的伤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半个月前才勉强可以行动，总算不用整日卧床了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "左乐怔怔地看着眼前那已几乎不是自己记忆中容貌的太合。\n风掀起了他斗篷的一角，左乐看到了那宽大衣袍下枯瘦的身形。\n曾经那个铁打般的汉子，如今却是形销骨立，仿佛经不住城头的一阵风。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太合叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这身拳脚功夫不过是外物，我依然是肃政院的监察御史，心中抱负总有施展之处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公子若是还要这样挂怀，那就是看轻太合了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......怎会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太合叔一身才学，怎会被这区区伤病限制住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是公子，大半年未见，看上去更壮实了些。将军见到你，应当欣慰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，父亲他......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "将军这几天一直在与司岁台和兵部开会议事，几乎没有片刻闲暇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在的局势......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只在旦夕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......现在朝中的态度，是不惜一战吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大荒城变故发生后，岁兽一事已然不是司岁台所能控制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "朝中内阁、六部，虽然还有些争议，但态度已经明确——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "永绝后患。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，这一战的后果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_mini01_villagevacancy"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g07_fairyland_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g08_pavilion"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g7_zuosroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说，月前，有其他秉烛人在百灶附近发现了那罪人的踪迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......我也听说了此事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "朝廷已经严加防备，出动了多位禁军。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然连禁军都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那罪人的手段难以预料，是当下最紧要的威胁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一个猜想，或许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在百灶城中，还有一位代理人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一位“年纪”最小的代理人，也是最为特殊的一位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "据司岁台的观测，他从走出那座陵墓起，这数百年里从未施展过任何权能。司岁台也不知该对他如何是好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯有一事可疑——百年前，他在望越狱后来到百灶，之后便一直逗留此处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "望之前曾频繁地接触其他代理人，他这次回来，恐怕留在百灶的这一位，也在他的计划之内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公子有何打算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道......所以要先去看个明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我自己去看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g13_yuskitchen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......完成！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样？从洗菜开始的每一道工序，我已经记得滚瓜烂熟了！一点都不用人帮忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也多亏行箸帮我想的办法，只要在上手和面之前，先把手在冰水里泡上五分钟就没有问题了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......看上去成色不错，味道上也有些神似小大厨的手艺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凑凑合合吧，还远谈不上以假乱真呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我这么多年的手艺，被一个没下过厨的人随随便便就学会了，那我不是白混了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "努力了这么多天，明天就要比赛了，你就不能说点鼓励的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是怕你得意忘形......不过留点心气也好，别到时候见了莫不服被吓得连菜刀都不会用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么好怕的，莫不服倚老卖老，你就去给他一点年轻人的颜色看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "万事俱备，明天就去决战鼎丰楼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
